{"pin":"BH00130","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00130","anchor":"","title":"Lawh-i-Ahbab","first_line":"This is a Book from Our presence unto him who, when he heard the Call from the direction of his Most Glorious Lord, responded \"Yea, verily, O my God!\" [3.5s]... ...O Pen of Revelation! Call thou to mind the Baptizer. Say: The Day of baptism hath come. Blessed is the one who hath baptized himself with the baptism of God","first_line_orig":"هذا کتاب من لدنا الی الذی اذا سمع الندا من شطر ربه الابهی قال بلی یا اله من  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"3770","notes":" \u003ca href=\"https://d9263461.github.io/cl/Baha'i/Others/ROB/V3/Contents.html\"\u003eROB3.258\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/o/GS/gs-187.html\"\u003eGSH.187\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#38\"\u003eLL#038\u003c/a\u003e","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"tablets","type_name":"Tablets of Bahá'u'lláh","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"},{"type":"tablets","type_name":"Tablets of Bahá'u'lláh","language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or11095#001","source":"BLIB_Or11095","locator":"001"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA34:069","source":"INBA34","locator":"069","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v034/?page=71"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQA1#002","source":"AQA1","locator":"002","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/Q1/q1-7.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ASAT3.071x","source":"ASAT3","locator":"071x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/429.pdf#page=38"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK4.476ax","source":"AVK4","locator":"476ax","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK4/ak4-480.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BCH.032x","source":"BCH","locator":"032x","url":"https://adibmasumian.files.wordpress.com/2021/02/bch.pdf#page=29"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MAS4.159x","source":"MAS4","locator":"159x","u